    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>My Furry Stepmom</strong> is another short novel in the &quot;My Furry&quot; series, telling the story of a guy who works as an actor. One day, he is offered a role in an unusual movie where he has to play the part of a stepson. He agrees, and on set, he meets a girl named Mila, who plays his stepmom. After several interactions and days spent together, they start to feel something deep in their hearts...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>My Furry Stepmom</strong> is a comedic story about love, career goals, and the ups and downs of film shooting. Spend time with Mila and discover what it feels like to be an actor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About 2-3 hours of content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique comedy story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relaxing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A touch of personal drama, as usual</p></li></ul>",
